#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:5
#: b6593c9483924569943efb38070ad0eb
msgid "UBlox GPS + Compass Module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:7
#: 8340c05855a84a83a7e85cf9bd2c869e
msgid "A UBlox GPS + Compass module is the most commonly used GPS for ArduPilot compatible autopilots. There are many versions of these modules available from various manufacturers, the recommended models are :ref:`here <common-positioning-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:10
#: 59bac5f5cb3b4bf9b21ed86fa35f6dec
msgid "ArduPilot automatically configures the GPS soon after startup so there is no need for any GPS related calibration.  The :ref:`compass must be calibrated <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` however."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:16
#: 4a437339f680488489e99d071973ac27
msgid "Connecting the Autopilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:25
#: 8e821e867c92413992253f7f260c9317
msgid "Example: Connecting to Pixhawk"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:27
#: 0acbc7097213405c9e02e282e326422c
msgid "Connect the GPS's 6-pin DF13 connector to the Pixhawk's \"GPS\" port and the compass's 4-pin connector to the I2C port.  Alternatively the compass can be first connected through an ``I2C splitter`` if other I2C devices are to be attached."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:35
#: 815695298d104b5aa6a6fc3be03156d9
msgid "Details on how to setup and use a 2nd GPS can be found on the :ref:`GPS Blending page <common-gps-blending>` page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:39
#: d6d990a96bdd4b759062b5e88ab808db
msgid "The baud rate is set by the UBlox driver (setting ``SERIAL4_BAUD = 38`` is ignored)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:43
#: 058423ed15b7433ab9a60f174acc94ea
msgid "ArduPilot supports many attached compasses, but only up to 3 compasses can be used during operation. See :ref:`common-compass-setup-advanced`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:47
#: 0986b4a1b4b84cdbbb05712981a5ce28
msgid "Mounting the GPS Module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:49
#: 634365ff358d4d2ba646d191f8bc3f4a
msgid "This module permits the GPS to be mounted separately from the flight control module so that it can have the best clear (view) of the sky and allows the compass to be distanced from interfering magnetic fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:55
#: 2301283dca4041d6b346baa6d4a96f99
msgid "The recommended orientation is to mount the module with the arrow facing toward the front of the vehicle and in the same direction as the arrow on the autopilot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:59
#: 694906fd747c4c0c87ec4eda6d5f0cbb
msgid "When mounting the GPS+Compass module:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:61
#: c2f55a4415f14c40bfbb0e09b4afa0c0
msgid "Place the module on the outside of your vehicle (in an elevated position if appropriate) with a clear view of the sky, as far as possible from the motors and ESCs, with the arrow facing forward."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:64
#: 3e3e6c7ab6ba4ad3ac29fd911a797fda
msgid "Distance the module from DC power wiring and the batteries by at least 10cm.  Use of a GPS mast is highly recommended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:70
#: f3e65f5deb7d4d319b67d69865c29a54
msgid "Place the module clear of nearby iron containing metallic objects. (Use nylon or non magnetic stainless steel hardware and nylon or aluminum standoffs to mount the module)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:73
#: 6c2afcc7d89c41fc9cf8ac94396e9fb5
msgid "Twist power and ground wires where possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:79
#: 4d291299158f4a219ef3fe1177a64f62
msgid "Setup in Mission Planner"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:81
#: bb810ab879c14b33b27fcdd94382c9a4
msgid ":ref:`Compass Calibration in Mission Planner <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` explains the simplest way to calibrate a compass mounted in the recommended orientation (arrows for autopilot and compass facing to front of vehicle)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:86
#: 79e9e3b4d8c147d3b0bcb98ac1eccf89
msgid ":ref:`Advanced Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>` contains more detailed instructions for calibrating a compass if, for example, it has been mounted at some other orientation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module.rst:91
#: 262cd386117c47ba83c9907dc13d6d02
